  "label": "Reproductive Autonomy",
  "description": "The concept that individuals have the right to make decisions about their own reproductive health, including the choice to have or not have children, and access to reproductive healthcare services such as contraception and abortion. This concept is foundational to the 'my body my choice' slogan and is directly challenged by the visual metaphor of erasure in the meme.",
